For Inventory Idx:
  1. Go into Hero -&gt; EquipInventoryData
  2. Either navigate the inventory using the scripts at the start,
     change Idx directly, or use the "Print ..." scripts to
     find idx (inventory slot) of your item
  3. Change Inventory Idx under RemoveItem to the idx you found
  4. Enable "&gt; Remove by Inventory Idx" script

Alternatively you can choose an Item from the Item dropdown
and select "&gt; Remove by Item ID"
]])
